        "title": "Swarm agent deletion now drives the gateway to completion",
        "summary": "Deleting an agent that lives on the swarm now properly tears it down through the swarm gateway, with retry-and-stop handling so status probe agents no longer linger as orphans.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Agent delete on the server now detects swarm-hosted agents by machine type and routes the teardown through the configured swarm gateway, returning a clear service-unavailable error when SWARM_BASE_URL is missing instead of silently leaving remote state behind.",
