          {
            "text": "The swarm delete path now recognizes 409 \"needs stop\" responses, issues a stop call, and retries the delete up to twelve times with a 5-second backoff before surfacing a bad-gateway error — so probe agents that are still running get cleaned up instead of failing outright.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "90752cd1b06070f3a63d775aaa07c652124215b9"
            ],
